/** くらし: 住まい・車・自己投資（サービス・買い物・趣味）・事業・旅行・スポンサー・家族（アルバム）・お金（1 年の収支）。 */
import { CARS, HOUSING, SERVICES, SERVICE_DEFS, SPONSOR_TIERS, buyCar, housingOf, moveIn, sponsorTier, taxRate, toggleService, yearlyBudget } from '../../engine/career/life'
import {
  bizCycle,
  bizEstimate,
  bizLifetime,
  bizSellValue,
  bizUpgradeCost,
  bizYearly,
  bookTrip,
  buyPurchase,
  canBuy,
  canOpenBiz,
  canTrip,
  cancelTrip,
  canDonate,
  donate,
  legacyPoints,
  setFoundation,
  childPlaysLabel,
  cycleLabel,
  dropHobby,
  findBiz,
  openBiz,
  sellBiz,
  startHobby,
  tripCost,
  upgradeBiz,
} from '../../engine/career/lifePlus'
import { CAREER_BIZ, COMPANION_NAME, DONATIONS, FOUNDATION_TIERS, HOBBIES, HOBBY_MAX, PURCHASES, TRIPS, TRIP_BY_ID, type TripCompanion } from '../../engine/data/careerLife'
import { regionOf } from '../../engine/career/week'
import { CAST_BY_ID } from '../../engine/data/cast'
import { ageAt, absWeekOf } from '../../engine'
import { useGame, useGameState } from '../../stores/gameStore'
import { useCurrentScreen } from '../../stores/uiStore'
import { AppShell } from '../layout/AppShell'
import { useScreenState } from '../hooks/useScreenState'
import { formatMoneyShort } from '../format'
import { Initials, Portrait } from '../components/Portrait'

type Tab = 'home' | 'car' | 'invest' | 'business' | 'trip' | 'charity' | 'sponsor' | 'family' | 'money'
const TABS: [Tab, string][] = [
  ['home', '住まい'],
  ['car', '車'],
  ['invest', '自己投資'],
  ['business', '事業'],
  ['trip', '旅行'],
  ['charity', '社会貢献'],
  ['sponsor', 'スポンサー'],
  ['family', '家族'],
  ['money', 'お金'],
]

const yen = (man: number) => `${formatMoneyShort(Math.round(man))}円`
const sign = (v: number) => `${v >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${yen(v)}`

function InvestTab() {
  const state = useGameState()
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const c = state.career!
  return (
    <div className="space-y-3">
      <div>
        <div className="panel-head mb-1">サービス（毎年の費用。お金が足りなくなると自動でやめる）</div>
        <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          {SERVICES.map((id) => {
            const on = c.services?.includes(id)
            const d = SERVICE_DEFS[id]
            return (
              <div key={id} className={`panel-flat flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 ${on ? 'border-gold' : ''}`}>
                <div className="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <div className="text-[0.9rem] font-black">{d.name}</div>
                  <div className="text-[0.7rem] text-ink-dim">{d.desc}</div>
                  <div className="num text-[0.72rem] font-bold text-gold">年 {yen(d.cost)}</div>
                </div>
                <button className={`btn btn-sm ${on ? 'btn-gold' : 'btn-ghost'}`} disabled={!on && c.money < d.cost / 4} onClick={() => mutate((st) => toggleService(st, id))}>
                  {on ? 'やめる' : '頼む'}
                </button>
              </div>
            )
          })}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div className="panel-head mb-1">買い物（一度買えばずっと効く）</div>
        <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
          {PURCHASES.map((d) => {
            const why = canBuy(state, d.id)
            const owned = why === '持っている'
            return (
              <div key={d.id} className={`panel-flat flex flex-col gap-1 p-2.5 ${owned ? 'border-gold' : ''}`}>
                <div className="text-[0.88rem] font-black">{d.name}</div>
                <div className="text-[0.68rem] leading-snug text-ink-dim">{d.desc}</div>
                <div className="num text-[0.72rem] font-bold text-gold">{yen(d.cost)}</div>
                <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm mt-auto" disabled={!!why} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void buyPurchase(st, d.id))}>
                  {owned ? '持っている' : (why ?? '買う')}
                </button>
              </div>
            )
          })}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div className="panel-head mb-1">
          趣味（{HOBBY_MAX} つまで。毎週少しずつうまくなり、調子と経験点。同じ趣味の人とはデートがはずむ）
        </div>
        <div className="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2">
          {HOBBIES.map((d) => {
            const h = c.hobbies?.find((x) => x.id === d.id)
            const full = (c.hobbies?.length ?? 0) >= HOBBY_MAX
            return (
              <div key={d.id} className={`panel-flat flex flex-col gap-1 p-2 ${h ? 'border-gold' : ''}`}>
                <div className="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                  <span className="text-[0.88rem] font-black">{d.name}</span>
                  {h && <span className="num ml-auto text-[0.68rem] font-bold text-gold">腕前 {Math.round(h.skill)}</span>}
                </div>
                <div className="text-[0.66rem] leading-snug text-ink-dim">{d.desc}</div>
                {h ? (
                  <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm mt-auto" onClick={() => mutate((st) => dropHobby(st, d.id))}>
                    やめる
                  </button>
                ) : (
                  <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm mt-auto" disabled={full || c.money < d.cost} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void startHobby(st, d.id))}>
                    始める（{yen(d.cost)}）
                  </button>
                )}
              </div>
            )
          })}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div className="text-[0.7rem] text-ink-mute">自主トレ合宿は、試合のない週の過ごし方「自主トレ合宿」から行けます（ホームの画面）。</div>
    </div>
  )
}

function BusinessTab() {
  const state = useGameState()
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const c = state.career!
  const cyc = bizCycle(state)
  return (
    <>
      <div className="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 text-[0.78rem]">
        <span>
          景気: <b className={cyc >= 1 ? 'text-good' : 'text-bad'}>{cycleLabel(cyc)}</b>
        </span>
        <span>
          1 年の見込み: <b className={bizYearly(state) >= 0 ? 'text-good' : 'text-bad'}>{sign(bizYearly(state))}</b>
        </span>
        <span>
          通算の損益: <b className="num">{sign(bizLifetime(state))}</b>
        </span>
        <span className="text-ink-mute">売るときは、注ぎ込んだお金の 6 割が戻ります。</span>
      </div>
      <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
        {CAREER_BIZ.map((d) => {
          const b = findBiz(state, d.id)
          const why = canOpenBiz(state, d.id)
          const up = bizUpgradeCost(state, d.id)
          return (
            <div key={d.id} className={`panel-flat flex flex-col gap-1 p-2.5 ${b ? 'border-gold' : ''}`}>
              <div className="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                <span className="text-[0.92rem] font-black">{d.name}</span>
                {b && <span className="ml-auto rounded bg-gold px-1.5 text-[0.66rem] font-black text-[#2a1a00]">Lv{b.level}</span>}
              </div>
              <div className="text-[0.68rem] leading-snug text-ink-dim">{d.desc}</div>
              {b ? (
                <>
                  <div className="num text-[0.72rem]">
                    週 <b className={bizEstimate(state, d.id, b.level) >= 0 ? 'text-good' : 'text-bad'}>{sign(bizEstimate(state, d.id, b.level))}</b>・今季 {sign(b.season)}
                  </div>
                  <div className="mt-auto flex gap-1">
                    <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm flex-1 !px-1" disabled={up === null || c.money < (up ?? 0)} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void upgradeBiz(st, d.id))}>
                      {up === null ? '最大' : `広げる ${yen(up)}`}
                    </button>
                    <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm !px-2" onClick={() => mutate((st) => void sellBiz(st, d.id))}>
                      売る {yen(bizSellValue(b.invested))}
                    </button>
                  </div>
                </>
              ) : (
                <>
                  <div className="num text-[0.72rem]">
                    開業 <b className="text-gold">{yen(d.cost)}</b>・週の見込み {sign(bizEstimate(state, d.id, 1))}
                  </div>
                  <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm mt-auto" disabled={!!why} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void openBiz(st, d.id))}>
                    {why ?? '始める'}
                  </button>
                </>
              )}
            </div>
          )
        })}
      </div>
    </>
  )
}

function TripTab() {
  const state = useGameState()
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const c = state.career!
  const COMPS: TripCompanion[] = ['solo', 'partner', 'family', 'team']
  const t = c.trip
  return (
    <>
      <p className="mb-2 text-[0.76rem] text-ink-dim">
        オフの旅行はシーズン中に予約し、シーズンの終わりに出かけます（費用は予約のときに払い、取り消せば全額戻る）。メンタルの経験点と、新しいシーズンの調子。恋人や家族と行けば絆も深まり、アルバムに残ります。
      </p>
      {t && (
        <div className="panel-flat mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 border-gold p-2.5 text-[0.82rem]">
          予約: <b>{TRIP_BY_ID[t.id].name}</b>（{COMPANION_NAME[t.with]}・{yen(t.cost)}）
          <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm ml-auto" onClick={() => mutate((st) => cancelTrip(st))}>
            取り消す
          </button>
        </div>
      )}
      <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
        {TRIPS.map((d) => (
          <div key={d.id} className="panel-flat flex flex-col gap-1 p-2.5">
            <div className="text-[0.9rem] font-black">{d.name}</div>
            <div className="text-[0.68rem] leading-snug text-ink-dim">{d.desc}</div>
            <div className="mt-auto grid grid-cols-2 gap-1">
              {COMPS.filter((w) => canTrip(state, w)).map((w) => {
                const cost = tripCost(state, d.id, w)
                return (
                  <button key={w} className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm !min-h-[2.4rem] flex-col !gap-0 !px-1" disabled={c.money < cost} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void bookTrip(st, d.id, w))}>
                    {/* 「チームの仲間と」は 1 行に入らないので、行き先の人と費用を 2 行に */}
                    <span className="text-[0.66rem] leading-tight">{COMPANION_NAME[w]}</span>
                    <span className="num text-[0.7rem] leading-tight">{yen(cost)}</span>
                  </button>
                )
              })}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </>
  )
}

function CharityTab() {
  const state = useGameState()
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const c = state.career!
  return (
    <div className="space-y-3">
      <p className="text-[0.76rem] text-ink-dim">
        稼いだお金を、次の世代のために。財団は毎年の寄付、寄付は一度きり。知名度が上がり、キャリアの総括の「社会貢献」の点になります（評価と殿堂入りにも少し効く）。いまの点 <b className="text-gold">{legacyPoints(state)}</b>・寄付の通算 <b className="num">{yen(c.donated ?? 0)}</b>
      </p>
      <div>
        <div className="panel-head mb-1">財団（お金が足りなくなると、自動で休む）</div>
        <div className="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2">
          {FOUNDATION_TIERS.map((t) => {
            const sel = (c.foundation ?? 0) === t.level
            return (
              <button key={t.level} onClick={() => mutate((st) => setFoundation(st, t.level))} className={`rounded-xl border px-2.5 py-2 text-left ${sel ? 'border-gold bg-gold/15' : 'border-line/60 bg-black/[0.03]'}`}>
                <div className="text-[0.88rem] font-black">{t.name}</div>
                <div className="text-[0.66rem] leading-snug text-ink-dim">{t.desc}</div>
              </button>
            )
          })}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div className="panel-head mb-1">寄付（一度きり）</div>
        <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
          {DONATIONS.map((d) => {
            const why = canDonate(state, d.id)
            return (
              <div key={d.id} className={`panel-flat flex flex-col gap-1 p-2.5 ${why === '寄付した' ? 'border-gold' : ''}`}>
                <div className="text-[0.88rem] font-black">{d.name}</div>
                <div className="text-[0.68rem] leading-snug text-ink-dim">{d.desc}</div>
                <div className="num text-[0.72rem]">
                  <b className="text-gold">{yen(d.cost)}</b>・社会貢献 +{d.legacy}
                </div>
                <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm mt-auto" disabled={!!why} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void donate(st, d.id))}>
                  {why ?? '寄付する'}
                </button>
              </div>
            )
          })}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  )
}

export function LifeScreen() {
  const state = useGameState()
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const screen = useCurrentScreen()
  const [tab, setTab] = useScreenState<Tab>('tab', 'home', screen.params?.tab as Tab | undefined)
  const c = state.career!
  const region = regionOf(state)
  const cur = housingOf(state)
  const b = yearlyBudget(state)
  const tier = sponsorTier(state)
  const biz = bizYearly(state)
  const royalty = c.book && state.season - c.book.season < 3 ? c.book.royalty : 0
  return (
    <AppShell title="くらし" current="life" right={<span className="num text-[0.85rem] font-bold text-gold">貯金 {yen(c.money)}</span>}>
      <div className="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col gap-2 p-2">
        <div className="scroll-x shrink-0">
          <div className="seg">
            {TABS.map(([id, label]) => (
              <button key={id} aria-selected={tab === id} onClick={() => setTab(id)}>
                {label}
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div className="panel scroll-y min-h-0 flex-1 p-3">
          {tab === 'home' && (
            <>
              <p className="mb-2 text-[0.78rem] text-ink-dim">住まいは疲れの回復と調子に効きます。{region === 'us' ? 'いまはアメリカにいるので、アメリカの家に住めます。' : 'いまは日本にいるので、日本の家に住めます。'}買った家は、その国に戻ればいつでも住めます。</p>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                {HOUSING.filter((h) => h.region === region).map((h) => {
                  const owned = c.ownedHomes?.includes(h.id)
                  const here = cur.id === h.id
                  const price = h.kind === 'buy' && !owned ? h.cost : 0
                  return (
                    <div key={h.id} className={`panel-flat flex flex-col gap-1 p-2.5 ${here ? 'border-gold' : ''}`}>
                      <div className="text-[0.95rem] font-black">{h.name}</div>
                      <div className="text-[0.72rem] text-ink-dim">{h.desc}</div>
                      <div className="text-[0.72rem]">疲れの回復 +{h.recover}・くつろぎ +{h.comfort}</div>
                      <div className="num text-[0.78rem] font-bold text-gold">{h.kind === 'free' ? 'ただ' : h.kind === 'rent' ? `家賃 年 ${yen(h.cost)}` : owned ? '持ち家' : `買う ${yen(h.cost)}`}</div>
                      <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm mt-auto" disabled={here || c.money < price} onClick={() => mutate((st) => moveIn(st, h.id))}>
                        {here ? '住んでいる' : h.kind === 'buy' && !owned ? '買って住む' : '引っ越す'}
                      </button>
                    </div>
                  )
                })}
              </div>
            </>
          )}
          {tab === 'car' && (
            <>
              <p className="mb-2 text-[0.78rem] text-ink-dim">いい車は少しだけ知名度と気分を上げます（メーカーの名前は出しません）。車があると、アメリカでドライブのデートにも行けます。</p>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                {CARS.map((car) => {
                  const owned = c.cars?.includes(car.id)
                  return (
                    <div key={car.id} className="panel-flat flex flex-col gap-1 p-2.5">
                      <div className="text-[0.95rem] font-black">{car.name}</div>
                      <div className="text-[0.72rem] text-ink-dim">{car.desc}</div>
                      <div className="num text-[0.78rem] font-bold text-gold">{yen(car.price)}</div>
                      <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm mt-auto" disabled={owned || c.money < car.price} onClick={() => mutate((st) => buyCar(st, car.id))}>
                        {owned ? '持っている' : '買う'}
                      </button>
                    </div>
                  )
                })}
              </div>
            </>
          )}
          {tab === 'invest' && <InvestTab />}
          {tab === 'business' && <BusinessTab />}
          {tab === 'trip' && <TripTab />}
          {tab === 'charity' && <CharityTab />}
          {tab === 'sponsor' && (
            <>
              <p className="mb-2 text-[0.78rem] text-ink-dim">知名度が上がると、大きなスポンサーから話が来ます（話は代理人から届きます）。いまの知名度 {Math.round(c.fame)}。</p>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                {SPONSOR_TIERS.map((t) => {
                  const mine = c.sponsor === t.id
                  return (
                    <div key={t.id} className={`panel-flat p-2.5 ${mine ? 'border-gold' : ''} ${c.fame < t.fame ? 'opacity-60' : ''}`}>
                      <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span className="text-[0.92rem] font-black">{t.name}</span>
                        {mine && <span className="rounded bg-gold px-1.5 text-[0.68rem] font-black text-[#2a1a00]">契約中</span>}
                      </div>
                      <div className="text-[0.72rem] text-ink-dim">{t.desc}</div>
                      <div className="num text-[0.75rem]">
                        知名度 {t.fame} から・<span className="font-bold text-gold">年 {yen(t.pay)}</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  )
                })}
              </div>
              {tier && tier.id !== c.sponsor && <div className="mt-2 text-[0.75rem] text-gold">「{tier.name}」の話が来ます（次の週に代理人から）。</div>}
              <div className="panel-flat mt-3 flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5">
                <div className="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <div className="text-[0.88rem] font-black">メディアの依頼</div>
                  <div className="text-[0.7rem] leading-snug text-ink-dim">テレビや雑誌の依頼（出演料と知名度。少し疲れる）は、シーズンに 1〜2 回くらい代理人から届きます。受けないにすると、代理人が全部断ります。</div>
                </div>
                <div className="seg shrink-0">
                  <button aria-selected={!c.mediaOff} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void delete st.career!.mediaOff)}>
                    話を聞く
                  </button>
                  <button aria-selected={!!c.mediaOff} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void (st.career!.mediaOff = true))}>
                    受けない
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </>
          )}
          {tab === 'family' && (
            <div className="space-y-3">
              <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div className="panel-flat p-3">
                  <div className="panel-head mb-1">パートナー</div>
                  {c.spouse || c.partner ? (
                    <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                      <Portrait id={(c.spouse ?? c.partner)!} kind="face" className="face-round h-12 w-12" fallback={<Initials name={CAST_BY_ID[(c.spouse ?? c.partner)!].name} className="h-full w-full" />} />
                      <div>
                        <div className="font-black">{CAST_BY_ID[(c.spouse ?? c.partner)!].name}</div>
                        <div className="text-[0.75rem] text-ink-dim">
                          {c.spouse ? '結婚している' : '付き合っている'}・絆 {Math.round(c.bonds[(c.spouse ?? c.partner)!] ?? 0)}
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  ) : (
                    <div className="text-[0.8rem] text-ink-dim">絆が深まった人と何度かデートすると、特別な話があるかもしれません。結婚するには、付き合って 30 週・絆 95・持ち家が要ります。</div>
                  )}
                </div>
                <div className="panel-flat p-3">
                  <div className="panel-head mb-1">子ども</div>
                  {(c.children ?? []).length === 0 ? (
                    <div className="text-[0.8rem] text-ink-dim">まだいません。</div>
                  ) : (
                    c.children!.map((ch) => (
                      <div key={ch.name} className="text-[0.85rem]">
                        {ch.name}（{ch.sex === 'm' ? '男の子' : '女の子'}・{ageAt(absWeekOf(state.season, state.week), ch.birthAbs)} 歳）<span className="ml-1 text-[0.72rem] text-ink-dim">{childPlaysLabel(ch.plays)}</span>
                      </div>
                    ))
                  )}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div className="panel-flat p-3">
                <div className="panel-head mb-1">思い出のアルバム</div>
                {(c.album ?? []).length === 0 ? (
                  <div className="text-[0.8rem] text-ink-dim">オフの旅行に行くと、ここに残ります（旅行のタブで予約）。</div>
                ) : (
                  <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5">
                    {c.album!.map((a, i) => (
                      <div key={i} className="rounded-lg bg-black/[0.04] px-2 py-1.5 text-[0.75rem]">
                        <div className="font-black">{TRIP_BY_ID[a.trip]?.name}</div>
                        <div className="text-ink-dim">
                          {state.startYear + a.season} 年のオフ・{a.partner ? `${CAST_BY_ID[a.partner]?.name ?? ''}と` : COMPANION_NAME[a.with]}
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
            </div>
          )}
          {tab === 'money' && (
            <table className="num w-full max-w-[30rem] text-[0.85rem]">
              <tbody>
                {(
                  [
                    ['年俸', b.salary],
                    ['スポンサー', b.sponsor],
                    [`税金（${Math.round(taxRate(state) * 100)}%）`, -b.tax],
                    ['代理人の手数料（5%）', -b.agent],
                    ['家賃', -b.rent],
                    ['サービス', -b.services],
                    ['家族の生活費', -b.family],
                    ['身の回りの出費（スタッフ・警備・付き合い）', -b.lifestyle],
                    ['財団', -b.foundation],
                    ['事業（見込み）', biz],
                    ['自伝の印税', royalty],
                  ] as [string, number][]
                ).map(([k, v]) => (
                  <tr key={k} className="border-b border-line/30">
                    <td className="py-1">{k}</td>
                    <td className={`text-right ${v < 0 ? 'text-bad' : ''}`}>{yen(v)}</td>
                  </tr>
                ))}
                <tr>
                  <td className="py-1 font-black">1 年の手取り</td>
                  <td className={`text-right font-black ${b.net + biz + royalty < 0 ? 'text-bad' : 'text-gold'}`}>{yen(b.net + biz + royalty)}</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          )}
        </div>
      </div>
    </AppShell>
  )
}
